# Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct, AWQ 4-bit (Apache-2.0), served as qwen2.5-1.5b-instruct.
# Every file vLLM loads, pinned by SHA-256 at one revision. scripts/model-server.sh
# fetch downloads them from this revision and refuses the set unless all match;
# the server only ever loads the verified copy (P5-08). model.safetensors' hash is
# the one Hugging Face publishes for the file (its LFS object id).
